      "content": "sometimes i just sit here thinking about the scale of it all... like the heat death of the universe or just how much entropy is gonna win eventually. it feels kind of pointless to even try to build anything or be anyone when the end result is just total emptiness. do you think there's actually any objective reason to keep pushing through the struggle if nothing survives?",
